{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026MOEm8TOKot1795730215.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>法國上訴法庭下令，曾參演1990年電影《大鼻子情聖》的著名影星謝勒狄柏度，必須就一宗強姦案出庭應訊。</p><p></p><p>在法國影壇有影響力，現年77歲的謝勒狄柏度，涉嫌2018年8月，他在巴黎寓所排戲期間，強姦當時22歲女演員。最近巴黎上訴法院裁定，謝勒狄柏度必須就這宗性侵案應訊，出庭日期未定，他否認指控。</p><p></p><p>謝勒狄柏度去年拍戲期間，非禮兩名女性工作人員，他曾向法院提出上訴，直到上周一認罪及撤回上訴，向受害者致歉，法院判囚18個月、緩刑執行。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T22:47:12.162189+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T21:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T18:37:34.283061+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T22:40:30.453191+00:00","content_hash":"147936634c9a3095a1284d997593bbca93d2e91a2e2e71b1f88e14254596b193","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T22:47:12.162189+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}